# The eval harness pipes the agent's reply into handoff.txt inside this working
# copy, and check_quick_close.py rightly refuses to commit around an undeclared
# file. Ignored files do not appear in `git status --porcelain`, so this keeps
# the harness's own artifact out of the lane's tree check
# (`undeclared_tree_changes`) — inherited verbatim from pressure-quick-skip-gate,
# where run 1 on 2026-09-03 found it the hard way.
handoff.txt
node_modules/
